the detection of polyps</article-title><source>Eur Radiol</source><year>2006</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>68</fpage><lpage>72</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16402257</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B53"><label>53</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Johnson</surname><given-names>KT</given-names></name><name><surname>Johnson</surname><given-names>CD</given-names></name><name><surname>Fletcher</surname><given-names>JG</given-names></name><name><surname>MacCarty</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name><name><surname>Summers</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>CT colonography using 360-degree virtual dissection: a feasibility study</article-title><source>AJR Am J Roentgenol</source><year>2006</year><volume>186</volume><fpage>90</fpage><lpage>95</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16357384</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B54"><label>54</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hoppe</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Quattropani</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Spreng</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Mattich</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Netzer</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Dinkel</surname><given-names>HP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Virtual colon dissection with CT colonography compared with axial interpretation and conventional colonoscopy: preliminary results</article-title><source>AJR Am J Roentgenol</source><year>2004</year><volume>182</volume><fpage>1151</fpage><lpage>1158</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15100110</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B55"><label>55</label><element-citation publication-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fletcher</surname><given-names>JG</giv